settings":{"content":"<p>Beautiful traditional collection with excellent quality. My daughter looked gorgeous during our temple festival. The fitting was perfect, and the colors were vibrant. Will definitely order again.<\/p>","title":"Priya Nair","address":"Kochi, Kerala","rating":5}},"template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-3":{"type":"quote","settings":{"content":"<p>I was searching for authentic South Indian traditional wear online and found Pattupavadai. The dress arrived on time, and the craftsmanship was amazing. Everyone appreciated the outfit.<\/p>","title":"Kavitha R.","address":"Bengaluru, Karnataka","rating":4.5}},"template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-4":{"type":"quote","settings":{"content":"<p>Excellent customer service and premium-quality fabric. The stitching was neat, and the dress was very comfortable for my little girl to wear throughout the function. Truly worth the price.<\/p>","title":"Divya Krishnan","address":"Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu","rating":5}},"template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-5":{"type":"quote","settings":{"content":"<p>We ordered for our daughter's birthday celebration, and the dress was absolutely beautiful. The colors were rich, the material was soft, and delivery was quicker than expected. Very satisfied with the purchase.<\/p>","title":"Meera S","address":"Hyderabad, Telangana","rating":4}},"template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-6":{"type":"quote","settings":{"content":"<p>The quality is outstanding, and the design reflects traditional elegance. My daughter received so many compliments during the festival. This has become our favorite store for ethnic wear.<\/p>","title":"Lakshmi Menon","address":"Thrissur, Kerala","rating":5}},"template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-7":{"type":"quote","settings":{"content":"<p>We bought a traditional outfit for our family celebration, and the experience was excellent. The dress fit perfectly, arrived on time, and received so many compliments. Great quality, beautiful designs, and reliable service. Highly recommended!<\/p>","title":"Aravind Kumar","address":"Tirchi, Tamil Nadu","rating":5}}},"block_order":["template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-1","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-8","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-2","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-3","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-4","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-5","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-6","template--21324546343230__65bc9f5f-0663-4689-9a0a-a3b27651455e-quote-7"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"title":"What Our Client Says","subtitle":"","content":"","text_size":"medium","text_transform":"capitalize","show_text_bottom":false,"text_bottom":"<p>Trusted customers are our happiness. Contact us.<\/p><p><\/p>","hidden":false,"layout":"container","width_c":100,"style":"style2","use-slider":true,"slides-To-Scroll":1,"visible":3,"widescreen":3,"desktop":3,"laptop":3,"notebook":1,"tablet":1,"landscape":1,"portrait":1,"mobile":1,"rows":1,"autoplay":true,"speed":"600","autoplay-Speed":"5000","arrows":true,"fade":false,"center-Mode":false,"adaptive-Height":false,"dots":true,"infinite":true,"padding":10,"vertical":false,"cl_bg":"#f6f6f6","mg":"","pd":"20px,,20px,","mg_mb":"","pd_mb":"20px,,20px,"}},"footer_benifit_UTwaEm":{"type":"footer-benifit","blocks":{"benefit_XHnwBz":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Handpicked_Fabrics.png","icon_svg":"","title":"Handpicked Fabrics","description":"Selected one by one for their beauty, quality and uniqueness."}},"benefit_YiyHMk":{"type":"benefit","settings":{"icon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Timeless_Designing.png","icon_svg":""